      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"MappingContextEvent.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContextEvent</code></a> for the given <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>.",
