    {
      "source": "Base implementation of an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEvent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEvent</code></a> refering to a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>.",
